{"v":4,"catch":"超出此世界範圍的動作！","desc":"“GRADIUS”是KONAMI於1985年發布的射擊遊戲。\n玩家可以控制Super Dimension戰鬥機“ Vic Viper”，並藉助毀滅性的道具來戰鬥“細菌”。\n該射擊遊戲是KONAMI的傑作系列的第一部作品，對後來的射擊者產生了重大影響。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-07-09","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/db52748082249e5102555635cdfc99c0e9708bed71d02c321223a653a33eeca7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2a0c78fc4660370096c97b60e96baeaf890d2efb2185cdca793eb53c54ff1b81.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1c4cfaa02d3a65e970394d588900760e1c27d360b128e72731504ea09917620d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/74db01eb9ce9efec7fb7741607b22074ae768e9bb2df8c9ff892bae0e4b7e0a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/78ca212e48c198c555276d8ddbc73e08b32c96fc958d9cf46ff6f79fdcfb55eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/084e856bf5dbaf23f7a97c54fdea19aa902affd78d86bed44c38c68334f1df64.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a070105a6000","dlc":[]}